			<div class="content" id="post-content-2338115">
									

<p>I really liked this in the forums, and it has been tightened further, which is great (especially the changes to the first transcript).</p>
<p>I still have some misgivings, the biggest of which is that I don't understand how the Foundation can know so much about the mechanism of the anomaly, but still need to interview Timmons to find out the trigger. Nevertheless, upvoted.</p>
<p>Two minor suggestions:</p>
<ul>
<li>now that Timmons is interviewed by Harmon, the phrase &quot;you and I were investigating&#8230;&quot; doesn't make as much sense as before. Perhaps &quot;Fredricks and I&#8230;&quot;?</li>
<li>if you really wanted to twist the knife, perhaps have a line at the end of the last interview noting that Timmons requested to be housed in the same Temporary Holding Cell as -042, and was refused.</li>
</ul>

