			<div class="content" id="post-content-2338724">
									

<p>I like this. The fact that things look creepy from the outside, then get better when someone's watching is a unique touch. That said, it's missing two major details: What are the -B's, and what happened to Timmons? (Did she go through the ownership anomaly? I feel it's very important to state it, even just yea or nay.)</p>
